<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><meta name="description" content="Nu-Clear — Hungarian hardstyle DJ duo, releases, live shows and booking." /><meta name="keywords" content="Nu-Clear, Hungarian hardstyle, hardstyle DJ, raw hardstyle, melodic hardstyle, Denoiser, Adam Bass, hardstyle booking, Budapest hardstyle" /><meta name="author" content="Nu-Clear" /><meta name="theme-color" content="#070807" /><link rel="canonical" href="https://nu-clearmusic.com/" /><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/nu_clear_logo_rgb_white.png" /><meta property="og:type" content="website" /><meta property="og:url" content="https://nu-clearmusic.com/" /><meta property="og:site_name" content="Nu-Clear" /><meta property="og:locale" content="en_GB" /><meta property="og:locale:alternate" content="hu_HU" /><meta property="og:title" content="Nu-Clear — Hungarian Hardstyle DJ Duo" /><meta property="og:description" content="Official Nu-Clear website — music, releases, live shows and booking." /><meta property="og:image" content="https://nu-clearmusic.com/images/hard-1188-og.jpg" /><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Nu-Clear — Denoiser and Adam Bass" /><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" /><meta name="twitter:title" content="Nu-Clear — Hungarian Hardstyle DJ Duo" /><meta name="twitter:description" content="Official Nu-Clear website — music, releases, live shows and booking." /><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://nu-clearmusic.com/images/hard-1188-og.jpg" /><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"MusicGroup","name":"Nu-Clear","url":"https://nu-clearmusic.com/","genre":["Hardstyle","Raw Hardstyle","Melodic Hardstyle"],"foundingDate":"2019","member":[{"@type":"Person","name":"Denoiser"},{"@type":"Person","name":"Adam Bass"}],"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/nuclearofficial","https://www.instagram.com/nuclearhardstyle/","https://open.spotify.com/artist/53STPXwuwQrpWViWaQ3KXI","https://www.youtube.com/@nu-clear_official3793"]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Veszett Rave presents: COSMIC CONQUEST","startDate":"2026-09-26T22:00:00+02:00","endDate":"2026-09-27T07:00:00+02:00","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"SPOTx Club","address":"Vegyigépgyár utca 1., Budapest, Hungary"},"performer":{"@type":"MusicGroup","name":"Nu-Clear"},"url":"https://www.facebook.com/events/2882423862115069/"}</script><title>Nu-Clear — Hungarian Hardstyle DJ Duo</title></head><body>
<header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Nu-Clear home"><img src="/images/nu_clear_logo_rgb_white.png" alt="Nu-Clear logo" /></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#about" data-en="About" data-hu="Bemutatkozás">About</a><a href="#music" data-en="Music" data-hu="Zenék">Music</a><a href="#dates" data-en="Shows" data-hu="Fellépések">Shows</a><a href="#booking" data-en="Booking" data-hu="Booking">Booking</a></nav><div class="header-tools"><button class="lang active" data-set-lang="en">EN</button><span>/</span><button class="lang" data-set-lang="hu">HU</button><a class="header-cta" href="#booking" data-en="Book Nu-Clear ↗" data-hu="Booking ↗">Book Nu-Clear ↗</a></div></header>
<main id="top">
<section class="hero section-wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span><span data-en="Hungarian hardstyle formation · 2019" data-hu="Magyar hardstyle formáció · 2019">Hungarian hardstyle formation · 2019</span></p><img class="hero-logo" src="/images/nu_clear_logo_rgb_white.png" alt="Nu-Clear" /><p class="hero-intro" data-en="Melodic energy. Raw power. One shared frequency." data-hu="Dallamos energia. Nyers erő. Egy közös frekvencia.">Melodic energy. Raw power. One shared frequency.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-lime" href="#booking" data-en="Request a booking ↗" data-hu="Booking kérése ↗">Request a booking ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="#about" data-en="Discover the project ↓" data-hu="Ismerd meg a formációt ↓">Discover the project ↓</a></div></div><div class="hero-art"><img src="/images/hard-1188.jpg" alt="Nu-Clear members Denoiser and Adam Bass" /></div></section>
<div class="ticker"><span>HARDSTYLE / MELODIC / RAW / ENERGY / BUDAPEST / WORLDWIDE / </span><span>HARDSTYLE / MELODIC / RAW / ENERGY / BUDAPEST / WORLDWIDE / </span></div>
<section id="about" class="section-wrap about-section"><div class="section-label"><span>01</span><span data-en="The formation" data-hu="A formáció">The formation</span></div><div class="about-grid"><div><h2 data-en="Two minds.<br /><em>One impact.</em>" data-hu="Két alkotó.<br /><em>Egy energia.</em>">Two minds.<br /><em>One impact.</em></h2></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="lead" data-en="Nu-Clear is a Hungarian hardstyle formation founded in 2019 by two experienced DJs, Denoiser and Adam Bass." data-hu="A Nu-Clear egy 2019-ben alakult magyar hardstyle formáció, amelyet két tapasztalt hazai DJ, Denoiser és Adam Bass hozott létre.">Nu-Clear is a Hungarian hardstyle formation founded in 2019 by two experienced DJs, Denoiser and Adam Bass.</p><p data-en="After more than fifteen years of working together, the project unites the many sides of hardstyle — from melodic, energetic sounds to the harder raw hardstyle edge." data-hu="A több mint tizenöt éves közös zenei munka után létrejött projekt a hardstyle különböző irányzatait egyesíti: a dallamosabb, energikus hangzásoktól egészen a keményebb raw hardstyle vonalig.">After more than fifteen years of working together, the project unites the many sides of hardstyle — from melodic, energetic sounds to the harder raw hardstyle edge.</p><p data-en="Their music has appeared on Dutch Master Works, Hardstyle Revolution, Hard Music Records, Hardtype Records and Bonkers. They have also played in Hungary, Vienna and Croatia." data-hu="Zenéik többek között a Dutch Master Works, a Hardstyle Revolution, a Hard Music Records, a Hardtype Records és a Bonkers kiadókon jelentek meg. Magyarországon, Bécsben és Horvátországban is felléptek.">Their music has appeared on Dutch Master Works, Hardstyle Revolution, Hard Music Records, Hardtype Records and Bonkers. They have also played in Hungary, Vienna and Croatia.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="music" class="section-wrap music-section"><div class="section-label"><span>02</span><span data-en="Music & releases" data-hu="Zenék és megjelenések">Music & releases</span></div><div class="music-grid"><div><h2>Press<br /><em>play.</em></h2><p class="muted" data-en="Listen to Nu-Clear on Spotify and explore the latest releases." data-hu="Hallgasd a Nu-Cleart Spotifyon, és fedezd fel a legújabb megjelenéseket.">Listen to Nu-Clear on Spotify and explore the latest releases.</p></div><div class="player"><div class="player-heading"><span class="player-art">NC</span><div><p class="kicker">Spotify</p><h3>NU-CLEAR / ARTIST PROFILE</h3></div></div><iframe title="Nu-Clear Spotify artist profile" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/artist/53STPXwuwQrpWViWaQ3KXI?utm_source=generator" loading="lazy" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"></iframe><a class="spotify-link" href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/53STPXwuwQrpWViWaQ3KXI" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-en="Open on Spotify ↗" data-hu="Megnyitás Spotifyon ↗">Open on Spotify ↗</a></div></div><div class="release-strip">{releases.map(([index,title,meta,url]) => <a class="release-card-link" href={url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="release-index">{index}</span><div><p class="kicker">Release</p><h3>{title}</h3><p class="release-meta">{meta}</p></div><span>↗</span></a>)}</div><div class="video-embed"><iframe title="Nu-Clear latest release on YouTube" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/PX3VGezr33Q?rel=0" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></section>
<section id="dates" class="section-wrap dates-section"><div class="section-label"><span>03</span><span data-en="Upcoming appearances" data-hu="Közelgő fellépések">Upcoming appearances</span></div><div class="dates-list"><article class="show-row next-event"><div class="show-date"><strong>26</strong><span>SEP</span></div><div class="show-main"><p class="kicker" data-en="Next event · 2026 · 22:00—07:00" data-hu="Következő esemény · 2026 · 22:00—07:00">Next event · 2026 · 22:00—07:00</p><h3>{nextEvent.title}</h3><p>SPOTx Club · Vegyigépgyár utca 1., Budapest</p><a class="event-details" href={nextEvent.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-en="Details on Facebook ↗" data-hu="Részletek a Facebookon ↗">Details on Facebook ↗</a></div><a class="arrow-link" href={nextEvent.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="Open event on Facebook">↗</a></article><div class="archive-heading"><span data-en="Previous appearances" data-hu="Korábbi fellépések">Previous appearances</span><a href="https://www.facebook.com/nuclearofficial/events" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-en="View Facebook archive ↗" data-hu="Facebook-archívum megnyitása ↗">View Facebook archive ↗</a></div>{archiveEvents.map(([date,title,venue,url]) => <article class="archive-row"><span class="archive-date">{date}</span><div><h3><a href={url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{title} ↗</a></h3><p>{venue}</p></div></article>)}</div></section>
